infographic list-column-simple-vertical-arrow
data
  title Five Collector failure modes — each detectable before the outage, with one fix
  desc Each silently loses telemetry at scale, but each surfaces in a self-monitoring metric, a canary, or a cardinality alert before it causes an incident — only if you instrument the Collector as rigorously as the app
  lists
    - label OOM under tail sampling
      desc The gateway buffer grows past the memory limit because decision_wait is too long or trace volume spiked. Detect — dropped_spans non-zero, tail_sampling_count_traces_on_memory above num_traces. Fix — memory_limiter before tail_sampling; size num_traces for peak_rate × decision_wait × 2.
    - label Tail-sample re-routing on scale events
      desc The gateway pool scales up, the loadbalancing exporter hash ring re-shuffles, and in-flight traces lose some spans. Detect — incomplete traces during scaling. Fix — pre-warm new pods, scale conservatively, use longer convergence windows on the loadbalancing exporter.
    - label OTLP version mismatch
      desc A Collector upgraded ahead of its SDKs hits an unknown field in a newer OTLP proto and may silently drop attributes or whole records. Detect — staged-upgrade canary. Fix — SDK/Collector compatibility matrix; never upgrade the Collector ahead of the SDKs it receives from.
    - label Auto-instrumentation footprint regression
      desc A new minor of the Java Agent adds an instrumentation that slows a critical library, raising p99 ~8%. Detect — p99 latency on the affected service after a canary. Fix — canary the agent upgrade; per-instrumentation opt-out (OTEL_INSTRUMENTATION_X_ENABLED=false).
    - label Cardinality leak via auto-instrumentation
      desc An auto-instrumented HTTP client adds url.full (raw URL with query params) as an attribute, exploding metric-backend cardinality. Detect — cardinality explorer shows series count growing exponentially. Fix — use http.route (templated) instead of url.full; strip query strings via an attributes processor.
theme
  palette #f43f5e #f59e0b #6366f1 #14b8a6
